        "en": "Pet owners share widespread praise for the veterinary team, highlighting Dr. Valencia, Dr. Moghadam, and their attentive assistants. Reviewers emphasize that technicians treat nervous dogs and cats with exceptional gentleness during exams. Even in emergency situations requiring surgery, staff remain composed and supportive throughout the care process."
