      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently appreciate clear price estimates delivered upfront without unexpected upsells. Many pet parents note significant savings on annual checkups and vaccines compared to independent neighborhood clinics. Furthermore, reviewers mention that Petco Vital Care memberships provide valuable discounts on comprehensive routine tests."
      }
    },
