        "en": "Communication receives mostly positive remarks alongside a few administrative frustrations. Owners applaud clinicians who send regular procedural updates and explain surgical steps clearly. However, isolated reviews point to communication breakdowns and challenges with ongoing medication refills when a treating doctor departs the facility."
      }
